<title>POLAND: VISCOPLAST SWINGS TO LOSS IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>VISCOPLAST SWINGS TO LOSS IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 2.57 vs   0.42 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.71 vs   0.97 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.07 vs   1.08</p>
<p> Sales		    5.02 vs   3.72</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.23 vs   0.89 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.23 vs   1.90 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.92 vs   2.11</p>
<p> Sales		   26.67 vs  22.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical firm is Viscoplast SA.</p>
<p>The company said that due to a 4,894,539-zloty provision for</p>
<p>flood damages made in June its pre-tax profit then turned to a</p>
<p>1.2- million-zloty loss.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
